// The Go binding lives in bindings/go. The module is rooted here so that the
// release tags version it. Go requires the path of a module at v2 or later to
// end in its major version, so the first release of epoch 2 changes the path to
// maplibre.org/maplibre-native-ffi/v2.
module maplibre.org/maplibre-native-ffi

go 1.26
